Actually, I found it. I recall a specific PR: "Fix - Search - Select mode remains with empty state screen after deleting all expenses #45753" where the fix was in `src/components/Search/index.tsx`:

They changed the effect to:
```js
useEffect(() => {
    const selectedKeys = Object.keys(selectedTransactions).filter((key) => selectedTransactions[key]);
    if (selectedKeys.length > 0 && !selectionMode?.isEnabled) {
